    "title": "Hal Turner Radio Show - Kremlin Info Regarding Visit by US CIA Director",
    "text": "The Russian Federation's Kremlin Spokesman Dmitry Peskov has publicly stated the following regarding yesterday's visit to Moscow by US CIA Director John Ratcliff:\nRussian President Putin was briefed on the results of contacts with CIA Director Ratcliffe.\nIt is premature to talk about the impact of the CIA Director's contacts with Russian intelligence agencies on resolving the crisis in Russia-US relations.\nThere were no contacts between Putin and CIA Director Ratcliffe.\nThere are currently no planned contacts between Russia's Presidential Administration and the US.",
    "summary": "The Russian Federation's Kremlin Spokesman Dmitry Peskov has publicly stated the following regarding yesterday's visit to Moscow by US CIA Director John Ratcliff: Russian President Putin was briefed on the results of contacts with CIA Director Ratcliffe. It is premature to talk about the impact of the CIA Director's contacts with Russian intelligence agencies on resolving the crisis in Russia-US relations. There were no contacts between Putin and CIA Director Ratcliffe. There are currently no planned contacts between Russia's Presidential Administration and the US.",
